TEST 2 — PRECISION LOUPE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ ] Press and hold while drawing a pasture; confirm the magnified inset and crosshair.
[ ] Release after positioning; confirm the crosshair coordinate is accepted exactly once.
[ ] Repeat while moving a corner, placing a gate, moving water, and placing both paddock
