[ ] Confirm the plan changes no herd location, movement, circuit, water assignment, gate,
    rest result, or historical forage observation.
[ ] Archive the plan; confirm it stops rendering but remains retained.
[ ] Confirm Delete Blueprint warns that the reusable no-redraw promotion seam will be lost
